\{title:crimrecbars\}\
\
\{phang\}\
\{cmd:crimrecbars\} \'97 Plots marginal effects of criminal record across job contexts\
\
\{title:Syntax\}\
\
\{p 8 12 2\}\
\{cmd:crimrecbars\}\
\
\{title:Description\}\
\
\{pstd\}\
\{cmd:crimrecbars\} performs regression and margins analysis using the `callback` outcome and plots marginal effects of criminal record across different subgroups: city, customer service, manual skill, and employer interaction.\
\
\{title:Saved Graphs\}\
\
\{p 8 12 2\}\
- bar_crimrec_city.png  \
- bar_crimrec_custserv.png  \
- bar_crimrec_manual.png  \
- bar_crimrec_interact.png\
\
